Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.10,0:02:02.48,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}終わりが来たら　なんて言おう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.67,0:02:07.95,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}どうせならほら　悲しくないように
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.14,0:02:13.40,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}いつかのあなたの言葉が
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:16.36,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}ひどく刺さってる　
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:18.62,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}温かく　
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:22.12,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:32.90,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}知れば知れるだけでいいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.90,0:02:35.31,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}何かを求めてしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.70,0:02:38.62,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}大丈夫どこにも行かないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:40.71,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}どこにも行けないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:45.42,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}忘れないのに
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.36,0:02:51.08,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}なぜか遠くなる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:57.30,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}瞳の裏にいつも君は居る
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:03:02.10,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}今もずっとそう
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:04.14,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}いつかね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.14,0:03:05.37,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}もう少しね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:09.57,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}世界に優しい風が吹いたら
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.57,0:03:13.65,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}何か変わるのでしょうか
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:16.27,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}「帰りたい場所がある」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:19.12,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}誰もがこの星の子孫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:20.64,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}約束はね　
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.64,0:03:22.02,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}大事にね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:24.18,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}温かく
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:26.43,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.10,0:02:02.48,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}当结局到来 说些什么好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.67,0:02:07.95,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}终究有这么一天 要不就别那么悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.14,0:02:13.40,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}曾几何时你给我的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:16.36,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}依然深深刺痛着我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:18.62,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}留在心底
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:22.12,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}温暖着我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:32.90,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}知道了 也就知道了就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.90,0:02:35.31,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}却还是不自觉地追寻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.70,0:02:38.62,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}没关系 我哪儿都不会去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:40.71,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}也哪儿都去不了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:45.42,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}明明不会忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.36,0:02:51.08,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}却渐渐模糊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:57.30,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}瞳孔里总之映照着你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:03:02.10,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}现在也一直是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:04.14,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}总有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.14,0:03:05.37,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}再多一些
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:09.57,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}当温柔的风吹过全世界
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.57,0:03:13.65,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}会不会带来新的变化呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:16.27,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}「我有想回去的地方」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:19.12,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}每个人都是这颗星球的子孙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:20.64,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}约定的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.64,0:03:22.02,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}放在心里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:24.18,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}留在心底
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:26.43,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}温暖着我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.39,0:22:22.19,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}So don't you worry
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:26.75,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}あなたに知られないように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.56,0:22:31.61,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}あなたを守れますように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.81,0:22:37.51,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}The story has only just begun
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:40.35,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}あてのない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.18,0:22:44.81,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}道なき道にいてもどうか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.70,0:22:49.76,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}迷いながらいてもどうか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.00,0:22:52.19,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}希望が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.19,0:22:54.76,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}そこにあるよう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.76,0:22:57.58,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}ともにあるよう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.58,0:22:59.57,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}We are…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.57,0:23:02.21,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}どこにでも行ける羽を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.21,0:23:03.84,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}We are…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.84,0:23:06.26,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}あなたに授けたの
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.26,0:23:13.37,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}どんな闇も晴らしてしまえるように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.61,0:23:17.38,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}You gave me Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.57,0:23:22.11,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}恐れずに進め Oh Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.11,0:23:26.47,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}振り返ればいつも Holy trace
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.47,0:23:30.64,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}あなたが笑ってた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.64,0:23:35.40,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}だからHoly brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.65,0:23:40.13,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}躓きながらでもHoly brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.13,0:23:44.54,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}私は踏みだせる 遠くへ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.54,0:23:49.22,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}あなたがいる場所へ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.39,0:22:22.19,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}所以你不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:26.75,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}小心翼翼不让你知晓
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.56,0:22:31.61,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}希望能永远保佑你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.81,0:22:37.51,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}故事才刚刚开始
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:40.35,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}就算在一条
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.18,0:22:44.81,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}没有终点的野径上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.70,0:22:49.76,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}即使已经迷茫于旅途
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.00,0:22:52.19,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}希望
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.19,0:22:54.76,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}请留在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.76,0:22:57.58,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}请与我同在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.58,0:22:59.57,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.57,0:23:02.22,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}送给你一对翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.22,0:23:03.84,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.84,0:23:06.26,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}它能带你去往任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.26,0:23:13.37,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}希望能帮你照亮一切黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.61,0:23:17.38,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}你赐予我神圣的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.57,0:23:22.11,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}不要害怕向前进 神圣的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.11,0:23:26.47,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}每次回首都能看到  神圣的轨迹
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.47,0:23:30.64,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}你的笑容就在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.64,0:23:35.40,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}所以啊 神圣的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.65,0:23:40.13,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}即使跌跌撞撞 神圣的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.13,0:23:44.54,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}我也可以迈出步伐 去往远方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.54,0:23:49.22,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}去往有你的地方
